OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves 'welcome' plans
OL,4,Afor affordable homes on former mill
OL,5,Asite
OL,6,
OL,7,FA new housing development has been
OL,8,Fapproved on the site of what was once
OL,9,Fone of the biggest employers in
OL,10,FSelkirk.
OL,12,FThe Heather Mills shut in 2009 after
OL,13,Falmost 150 years and was badly damaged
OL,14,Fby fire about a decade later - it was
OL,15,Fsubsequently demolished.
OL,17,FNow Scottish Borders Housing
OL,18,FAssociation (SBHA) has received
OL,19,Fapproval to build 59 affordable homes
OL,20,Fon the site.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
