OL,3,GNEWSACouncil approves 'welcome' plans
OL,4,Afor affordable homes on former mill
OL,5,Asite
OL,6,
OL,7,FChief executive Julia Mulloy said:
OL,8,F"Scotland is facing a housing
OL,9,Femergency, and developments like this
OL,10,Fare part of the solution."
